---
<section id="about" class="tab-panel hidden-panel about-panel">
  <aside class="about-socials">
    <a href="https://twitter.com/maestrokambi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter @maestrokambi</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/victorkambi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub /victorkambi</a>
    <a href="https://www.behance.net/victorkambi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Behance /victorkambi</a>
    <a href="https://www.figma.com/@victorkambi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Figma @victorkambi</a>
    <a href="mailto:work@victorkambi.com">Email work@victorkambi.com</a>
    <a class="about-cv" href="/Victor_Kambi_2026_CV.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Résumé/CV ↗</a>
